{"id":"cultura","lemma":"cultura","pos":"noun","rank":1927,"glosses":["culture","knowledge","erudition"],"ipa":"/kulˈtuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"culturas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-cultura.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ellas tienen su propia cultura.","en":"They have their own culture.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642189","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"own","l":"propio"},null]},{"text":"Hablaron de cultura.","en":"They talked about culture.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639465","words":[{"g":"to talk","l":"hablar"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Hay muchas culturas en la Tierra.","en":"There are many cultures on Earth.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Earth"}]},{"text":"Es importante entender que cada país tiene su propia cultura.","en":"It is important to understand that each country has its own culture.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693606","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"important"},{"g":"to understand"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"each"},{"g":"country"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"own","l":"propio"},null]},{"text":"Es bueno para nosotros el entender de otras culturas.","en":"It is good for us to understand other cultures.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"good"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"to understand"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},null]}]}